<%# Cup-level freeze shortcuts (R13). Competition day settles many categories
    at once, and visiting each one's page to press its own button is the part
    organizers would skip.

    Both directions confirm (R14, Q2). Per category, only unfreezing is
    consequential enough to ask; here freezing every category at once is too,
    because it is not obvious from the cup page which ones are about to change.

    No live rendering: this page is not a live-editing surface, so unlike the
    per-category controls there is nothing here to broadcast. %>
<div class="panel">
  <h3>Freeze</h3>
  <div class="panel_contents panel-actions">
    <span><%= t("admin.freezes.all.summary.pools", count: cup_pools_frozen_count(cup),
                total: cup_pool_freezable_count(cup)) %></span>
    <%= button_to t("admin.freezes.all.freeze.pools"), admin_cup_pool_freeze_path(cup),
          method: :post,
          form: {data: {turbo_confirm: t("admin.freezes.all.freeze_confirm.pools")}} %>
    <%= button_to t("admin.freezes.all.unfreeze.pools"), admin_cup_pool_freeze_path(cup),
          method: :delete,
          form: {data: {turbo_confirm: t("admin.freezes.all.unfreeze_confirm.pools")}} %>
  </div>
  <div class="panel_contents panel-actions">
    <span><%= t("admin.freezes.all.summary.bracket", count: cup_brackets_frozen_count(cup),
                total: cup_bracket_freezable_count(cup)) %></span>
    <%= button_to t("admin.freezes.all.freeze.bracket"), admin_cup_bracket_freeze_path(cup),
          method: :post,
          form: {data: {turbo_confirm: t("admin.freezes.all.freeze_confirm.bracket")}} %>
    <%= button_to t("admin.freezes.all.unfreeze.bracket"), admin_cup_bracket_freeze_path(cup),
          method: :delete,
          form: {data: {turbo_confirm: t("admin.freezes.all.unfreeze_confirm.bracket")}} %>
  </div>
</div>
